1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3-p156_4-2\">4.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Heinsoo\" title=\"Rob Heinsoo\">Rob Heinsoo</a> (June 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 156. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\">0-7869-1836-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS2.M-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS2.M_5-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in <a href=\"/wiki/Jeff_Grubb\" title=\"Jeff Grubb\">Jeff Grubb</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Julia_Martin\" title=\"Julia Martin\">Julia Martin</a> (1993). “Map”. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_2nd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 2nd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 2nd edition</a></i> (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>). ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/1-5607-6617-4\" title=\"Special:BookSources/1-5607-6617-4\">1-5607-6617-4</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3.M-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3.M_6-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip William